{"availability":"available","full":"bakulbadwal/tranche-ai","name":"tranche-ai","description":"Agent-attested, condition-gated capital release for VC deals — on-chain via EAS","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-08T02:44:26Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:35:27Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://tranche-ai.vercel.app/","topics":["ai-agents","base","base-testnet","blockchain","coinbase","coinbase-api","crypto","ethereum-attestation-service","foundry","smart-contracts","solidity","venture-capital","web3"],"demo":"https://tranche-ai.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.209Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.209Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.209Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.209Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live demo: tranche-ai.vercel.app · Contract (Base Sepolia): 0x5c0a...92f7A","Condition-gated capital release for venture-style deals. An investor funds a recipient in tranches; each tranche unlocks only after a milestone attestation — reviewed by an AI agent, posted on-chain via EAS, and left open to a dispute window — has stood unchallenged.","This is not a token-vesting/streaming project. Sablier and Superfluid already solved \"unlock tokens linearly over time\" — that's commoditized. Tranche AI solves a different problem: releasing capital on a condition, where the condition is real-world evidence that something happened, and where the entity judging that evidence is an AI agent whose verdict is checkable, not final."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bakulbadwal/tranche-ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"42e0fa49da5bb764e1ac3beb587ff6f6196bec9a6ac90cfa217b0a9ebda28220","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.357Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:17.357Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live demo: tranche-ai.ver